WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.514
The seven Ps take the classic four,

00:00:02.564 --> 00:00:03.364
product,

00:00:03.224 --> 00:00:04.024
price,

00:00:03.908 --> 00:00:04.708
place and promotion,

00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:06.830
and add three for services:

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:07.680
people,

00:00:07.446 --> 00:00:09.826
process and physical evidence.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.113
Qantas promises the Spirit of Australia.

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:15.058
Friendly crew are the people.

00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:17.051
Smooth check-in is the process.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:20.267
Lounges and uniforms are the physical evidence.

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:23.346
But if the app is clunky and flights run late,

00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:26.117
no advertising can hold that promise up.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:27.962
Use it like this:

00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:30.050
for a service brand cover all seven,

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.607
but spend most time on the three that prove the promise.
